WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
We now refine the FireSat tutorial tree.

2
00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:07.100 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
An attack describes a way to compromise
the asset’s required protection.

3
00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:10.160 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
A countermeasure describes
a defensive response,

4
00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:14.340 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
and a defeating attack examines how
that response could itself be overcome.

5
00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.560 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
These hypotheses require
supporting evidence.

6
00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:22.120 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Select Payload Downlink Feed
Interface and choose Add child.

7
00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:28.140 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Select Attack, name it Replay a detection
report, and choose Stage new node.

8
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.980 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
The new card is part of the draft.

9
00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.640 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Its not yet committed marker
means that Core has not assigned

10
00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:35.320 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
its authoritative identity.

11
00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:38.580 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Select the replay attack and
add a Countermeasure named

12
00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.200 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Enforce freshness window.

13
00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:43.400 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Then select that countermeasure
and add an Attack named

14
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.140 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Abuse counter rollover.

15
00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.540 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
We have made the protection claim
explicit and retained a plausible

16
00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:51.660 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
challenge to it, rather than
stopping the analysis at the

17
00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:52.860 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
first defensive measure.

18
00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.020 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Select a connection to open
the Relationship Inspector.

19
00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:59.960 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Review Sibling operator and
choose the appropriate AND, OR,

20
00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:02.720 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
or SAND relationship for the child group.

21
00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:05.520 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Use Stage relationship
to apply the decision.

22
00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:08.940 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
A SAND sequence uses
explicit sequence positions;

23
00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:12.240 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
moving cards across the screen
does not change that order.

24
00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:15.580 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Use Link existing when a
suitable Core attack or

25
00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:17.260 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
countermeasure already exists.

26
00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:20.620 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
A shared node keeps its
identity and inputs across

27
00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.140 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
its incoming relationships.

28
00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:25.680 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Review the resulting branch and
its assumptions before committing;

29
00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:29.620 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
these edits create analytical and
supporting Core relationships,

30
00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:31.620 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
not merely lines in a drawing.

31
00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:35.720 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
At the upper right of the canvas,
select Nocturne for dark mode,

32
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.400 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
then Parchment to return.

33
00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:39.620 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
This changes presentation only.
